      "typical_award_size": "Lone Oak Senior Apartments II: HOME loan of $11,041,628 (State Loan Agreement 23-HOME-16301) approved May 19, 2026 (Resolution 26-197) after a March 26, 2024 application of up to $12,200,000 (Resolution 24-119). Loan is deferred, repaid from residual receipts, 3% interest, 55-year term commencing at final certificate of occupancy, secured by deed of trust with senior and junior regulatory agreements and a replacement reserve agreement.",
